<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Jan trade deficit rises to $376 mln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Jan trade deficit rises to $376 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's trade deficit rose to a provisional $376 million in January from $241 million in December, compared to $107 million in January 1996, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Thursday.</p>
<p>		     (figures in million dollars)</p>
<p>			    Jan	 Dec	Jan 1996</p>
<p>    Exports	     652	 801	  824</p>
<p>    Imports	    1,028     1,042	 931</p>
<p>    Balance	    -376	-241	 -107</p>
</text>
